### Get all companies
GET http://localhost:5000/api/companies
Accept: application/json

###

### Get companies with pagination (page 1, size 5)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/companies/paging?page=1&size=5
Accept: application/json

###

### Get companies with pagination and sorting
GET http://localhost:5000/api/companies/paging?page=1&size=5&sortField=company_name&sortOrder=desc
Accept: application/json

###

### Create a new company
POST http://localhost:5000/api/companies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "companyName": "AquaHarvest",
  "companyCode": "ahv",
  "hotline": "+60123456789",
  "email": "info@aquaharvest.com",
  "address": "123 Ocean Road, JB"
}

###

### Get single company by ID
GET http://localhost:5000/api/companies/4
Accept: application/json

###

### Update a company
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/companies/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "companyName": "AquaHarvest Updated",
  "hotline": "+60129876543",
  "email": "updated@aquaharvest.com",
  "address": "Updated address"
}

###

### Soft delete a company
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/companies/1
Accept: application/json

###

### Get all sites for a company
GET http://localhost:5000/api/companies/1/sites
Accept: application/json

###

### Get paginated sites for a company
GET http://localhost:5000/api/companies/1/sites/paging?page=1&size=5&sortField=site_name&sortOrder=asc
Accept: application/json
